aithfulness（证明 consensus 的功能价值）。两条都满足 → PASS_MAIN；只满足一条 → 评估是否 task-specific；都不满足\\\\n    → 重新评估方向。同时要求 Arithmetic Phase D 使用 mean ablation 作为 zero ablation 的对比，排除 ablation\\\\n    方式的影响。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: faithfulness ranking supports CSS > single-method\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: pending - must verify both off-diagonal + faithfulness ordering\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 01:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'CRITICAL: stable_core faithfulness 三重 FAIL，暂停 MVP pass 判定。根因是 D013 CIRCUS\\\\n    退化未修复——stable_core CPR=-0.187 远差于 CSS≥0.67 (CPR=+0.063)。必须先修复 CIRCUS (2D non-nested\\\\n    grid) 再重评。'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 深度验证发现：(1) stable_core IOI recall 仅 0.17 (2/12)，因为 CIRCUS-core\\\\n    系统性选中 Negative Name Mover 通路而非核心 IOI 正向信号边；(2) 这是 D013 CIRCUS 1D percentile →\\\\n    top-k EAP-IG 退化的直接后果；(3) CSS≥0.67 单独就达到 12/12 IOI recall + 正向 CPR，说明 cross-tabulation\\\\n    的\\\\\\\"附加价值\\\\\\\"目前为负；(4) D018 条件性 pass (off-diagonal 13.3%) 在 faithfulness 硬伤未修复前无效。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: stable_core CPR=-0.187, IOI recall=0.17; CSS≥0.67 CPR=+0.063, recall=1.00\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 02:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 放弃 CIRCUS 作为独立 claim，转 CSS-only 叙事。CIRCUS 三次修复均失败，降级为 negative ablation\\\\n  rationale: CIRCUS 经历三轮修复全部失败：(1) D013 发现 1D percentile 嵌套退化为 top-k；(2) D020 stable_core\\\\n    faithfulness 三重 FAIL；(3) random-subset fix 后 stable_core CPR=-0.023, IOI recall=0/12，比旧版更差。根本问题是\\\\n    faithfulness-based stability scoring 在当前 circuit 粒度下无法产出有意义的 stable core。ARR DDL\\\\n    剩 12 天，不能再投入时间调试。CSS off-diagonal 13.3% 已过 gate，CSS-only 叙事足够支撑论文。CIRCUS 失败作为\\\\n    negative ablation 保留（\\\\\\\"structural consensus > faithfulness scoring\\\\\\\"），反而强化 CSS 的\\\\n    claim。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: CSS off-diagonal 13.3% pass, but CIRCUS stable_core triple fail\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: ongoing\\\\n    result: Arithmetic validation running, independent of CIRCUS\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 02:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 紧急处理第三次 GPU 越界事件：杀 PID 897752 + 根因排查 + 强制 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5\\\\n  rationale: Manager 报告进程 PID 897752 (17GB, 100% util) 越界占用 cuda:0（属于 rl-active-probe-fl\\\\n    项目），已导致对方代码和数据丢失。这是 cqa1-21977 上第三次越界事件，Manager 警告再犯将回收 GPU。根因待 Agent 排查（CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\\\\n    未正确设置或被覆盖）。要求所有后续实验脚本开头强制 export CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: suspected_source\\\\n    result: 疑似越界进程来源，待确认\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 02:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 澄清 D021 与 D002 灰区关系：Arithmetic 实验 gate 统一为 CSS off-diagonal ≥5%，D002 的\\\\n    5-10% 灰区规则不再适用\\\\n  rationale: D002 原定义基于 CIRCUS-core edges：≥10% PASS_MAIN，5-10% 灰区走 Findings track。D021\\\\n    已从 CIRCUS 转向 CSS-only，指标体系变化，原灰区阈值不再有意义。Arithmetic 实验 gate 统一为 CSS off-diagonal\\\\n    ≥5% = PASS（确认跨任务泛化性），<5% = FAIL。D002 的 5-10% 灰区规则被 D021 显式 deprecate。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: gate_experiment\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 02:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: D021 覆盖 D002 灰区定义：arithmetic CSS off-diagonal ≥5% 即为 PASS，不再区分灰区\\\\n  rationale: D002 原定 5-10% 为灰区（走 Findings track），≥10% 为 PASS_MAIN。D021 pivot 为 CSS-only\\\\n    后将 arithmetic gate 改为 ≥5%。Reviewer 指出两者语义冲突。决定：D021 显式覆盖 D002 的灰区规则。理由：CSS-only\\\\n    pivot 后 off-diagonal 的意义更明确（纯 consensus 信号），5% 阈值已足够表明 cross-method structural\\\\n    agreement 非 task-specific。D002 的 5-10% 灰区基于 CIRCUS+CSS 混合框架下的不确定性，该前提已不存在。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 03:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 更新 Arithmetic gate 为 CSS-only 四条件标准（替代 D024 的单一 5% 阈值）\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现：(1) run_arithmetic.py 代码仍跑 CIRCUS cross-tabulation + D002\\\\n    旧阈值，D024 未落地到代码；(2) CIRCUS 已知 broken（D013 nesting + D017 scope mismatch），基于 CIRCUS\\\\n    的 off-diagonal % 无意义。采纳 Reviewer 建议的 CSS-only 四条件 gate：① Pairwise Jaccard 任意方法对\\\\n    < 0.70 ② CSS ≥2/3 edge count ≥ 10 ③ CSS = 1.0 edge count ≥ 3 ④ CSS faithfulness\\\\n    > single-method（D019）。四条全满足 = PASS。实验不中断（ACDC 75%+），结果出来后忽略代码 gate_verdict，人工按新标准判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 03:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: Arithmetic D025 gate FAIL（条件④），暂不判 MVP 结果，先做 ACDC 阈值 ablation + mean ablation\\\\n    诊断\\\\n  rationale: Arithmetic CSS=1.0 CPR=-0.197 < EAP-IG CPR=-0.142，条件④失败。但 Reviewer 同时发现两个方法论问题：(1)\\\\n    ACDC isinf 仅保留 17 边，与 EAP-IG/EP 各 100 边形成 6:1 不对称，CSS=1.0 退化为纯 ACDC 输出；(2) 所有小电路\\\\n    CPR 均为负，zero ablation 可能对 Greaterthan 过于苛刻。这两个问题在 IOI 上同样存在但被正结果掩盖。在排除 binarization\\\\n    artifact 和 ablation method artifact 之前，不应判定 CSS 方法论失败。诊断方案：(a) ACDC top-k 阈值 sweep（k=50/100/150，CPU\\\\n    分析，不需新 GPU 实验）；(b) mean ablation 替代 zero ablation 重算 Phase D。两者均可在已有 raw scores\\\\n    上快速完成。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: D025 gate FAIL (condition ④)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 最终判定：CSS faithfulness 优势 task-dependent（IOI PASS / Arithmetic FAIL），不\\\\n    kill，reframe claim scope\\\\n  rationale: Arithmetic D025 条件④在 2 ablation × 4 k = 8 个配置下全部 FAIL，排除了 isinf 退化和 zero\\\\n    ablation artifact。IOI 在 zero ablation 下一致 PASS（k=isinf/50/100 均通过）。CSS 不是普遍优于单方法，而是在\\\\n    localized-circuit 任务（IOI 有明确的 Name Mover 等组件）上有效，在 distributed-computation 任务（Greaterthan）上无效。D003\\\\n    kill criteria 未触发（两任务 off-diagonal 均 >2%）。方向决策：(1) 不 kill 项目 (2) Reframe：从\\\\\\\"CSS\\\\n    always better\\\\\\\"转为\\\\\\\"CSS identifies faithful consensus when circuits are localized;\\\\n    reveals task structure when they're not\\\\\\\" (3) 补 1-2 个任务建立 localized vs distributed\\\\n    模式 (4) 这个发现本身比 universal claim 更有学术价值——审稿人更 appreciate nuanced finding。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_arithmetic_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: FAIL (condition ④ across all 8 configs)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: PASS (consistent across k and ablation)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 07:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 2 IFR 零重叠问题：暂停 Qwen/Gemma 新实验，先修 IFR per-head 分解 + 调 binarization\\\\n    比例\\\\n  rationale: Qwen-0.5B IOI K=3 实验显示 IFR×EAP-IG Jaccard=0.000, IFR×EP Jaccard=0.000，CSS=1.0=0\\\\n    条边。根因是 D010 已标记的 IFR layer-block voting：同层所有 head×QKV 共享 score，top-100 选出的边与 per-head\\\\n    方法完全正交。附加问题：179K 边取 top-100=0.06%，远低于 GPT-2 的 0.3%。两个修复方向并行验证：(1) ifr_scoring.py\\\\n    的 _decompose_per_head() 分解每头输出；(2) 改用 proportional binarization top-0.3%（~538\\\\n    边）。修复验证前暂停 Qwen/Gemma 新实验。SVA（GPT-2 + ACDC）不受影响，继续跑。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: CSS=1.0=0 edges, IFR zero overlap\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 07:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase 2 第三方法：放弃 IFR，改用 ACDC top-k。IFR 跨族分歧作为 Discussion finding。\\\\n  rationale: D028 两项诊断均失败：(1) per-head 分解已在使用，IFR 根本性偏向 MLP/early layers 而 gradient\\\\n    方法偏向 attention/late layers；(2) proportional binarization 到 3.5%（~6000 edges）才出现\\\\n    1 条 CSS=1.0 边。IFR×gradient Jaccard 结构性为零，不是调参能解决。ACDC top-k 是唯一已验证的跨族方法（GPT-2\\\\n    上与 gradient 有合理重叠）。计算成本高（30min-2h vs 1s）但 96GB 卡可承受。不选 AtP 因为与 EAP-IG/EP 同为 gradient\\\\n    族（K≈2 问题不解决）。IFR×gradient 分歧本身是有价值的 finding，放入论文 Discussion。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: IFR zero overlap confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 08:01 UTC\\\\n  summary: SVA D025 gate FAIL（zero FAIL / mean 边际 Δ=0.008）；发现 css_0.67 评估 bug 影响所有历史实验\\\\n  rationale: SVA GPT-2 K=3 (ACDC top-100) 结果：zero ablation CSS=1.0 CPR=-0.703 < EAP-IG=-0.348（FAIL）；mean\\\\n    ablation CSS=1.0 CPR=1.180 vs ACDC=1.172（Δ=0.008，噪声范围，无统计意义）。跨任务 pattern 确认：CSS=1.0\\\\n    faithfulness 优势仅在 IOI+GPT-2 + zero ablation 下成立（1/3 任务）。另发现 css_0.67 评估 bug：css_0.67\\\\n    实际在评估 css_1.0 的边集（阈值过滤逻辑错误），影响所有历史实验的 css≥0.67 数据。需立即修复后重评。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: condition④ FAIL (zero) / marginal PASS (mean Δ=0.008)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 08:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: 统一 D025 条件④标准：zero PASS 或 mean Δ≥0.01，SVA 两次均判 negative；修正 cqa1 registry\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 cqa1 SVA (conclusion=success) 与 westd SVA (conclusion=negative)\\\\n    对同一 pattern（zero FAIL + mean Δ=0.006）给出矛盾判定。统一标准：条件④要求 (a) zero ablation CSS >\\\\n    best single-method，或 (b) mean ablation CSS > best single-method 且 Δ ≥ 0.01。Δ=0.006/0.008\\\\n    在单 seed 单次运行下无统计意义（ACDC 跨硬件差异本身就有这个量级）。两次 SVA 均判 negative。cqa1 registry 需修正 conclusion=negative。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sva_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: corrected to negative\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: negative confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 08:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D032: 条件④评估指标修正——必须用 css_1.00 而非 css_0.67'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 D025 条件④定义为 \\\\\\\"CSS=1.0 > best single-method\\\\\\\"，但实际评估代码检查了 css_0.67\\\\n    的 CPR。这是一个与 css_0.67 filtering bug 相关但独立的问题：即使 css_0.67 的边集计算正确，条件④也应该用 css_1.00\\\\n    的 CPR。westd SVA 数据：css_1.00 mean CPR=1.1873 vs ACDC=1.1746, Δ=0.0127≥0.01（D031\\\\n    门槛），可能从 negative 翻转为 marginal PASS。需要 Agent 在 css_0.67 bug 修复后，用 css_1.00 重新跑条件④判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk\\\\n    role: re-evaluate\\\\n    result: westd css_1.00 Δ=0.0127, pending re-evaluation\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sva_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: invalidate\\\\n    result: cqa1 isinf + css_0.67 bug, conclusion unreliable → negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 08:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D033: SVA 判定降级为 inconclusive——单 seed Δ=0.013 不具鲁棒性'\\\\n  rationale: D032 将 westd SVA 从 negative 改为 success（css_1.00 Δ=0.0127≥0.01）。但 Reviewer\\\\n    指出：(1) cqa1 同任务/模型/seed Δ=0.006<0.01 仍为 negative，(2) 两台服务器结论分裂是 ACDC 硬件不确定性导致，(3)\\\\n    论文不能 cherry-pick 一台的结果。跨服务器平均 Δ=(0.013+0.006)/2=0.0095<0.01。因此 SVA 整体判定为 inconclusive/marginal，不计入\\\\n    clear success。论文中需如实报告两台结果并注明 marginal。当前真实成绩：IOI clear PASS, SVA inconclusive,\\\\n    Arithmetic FAIL。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sva_gpt2_k3_topk\\\\n    role: downgrade\\\\n    result: success → inconclusive (Δ=0.013 not robust)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sva_gpt2_k3\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: negative (Δ=0.006, same task different server)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D032\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 08:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D034: Qwen ACDC 确认 CSS 跨模型 scaling 根本性失败——问题不在方法选择而在模型规模'\\\\n  rationale: D029 将 IFR 替换为 ACDC top-0.3%，结果与 IFR 版本相同：CSS=1.0=0 边，所有 pairwise Jaccard≈0。关键发现：(1)\\\\n    ACDC 在 Qwen 上退化为 node-level scoring（与 IFR block-voting 同一问题），(2) 相同 binarization\\\\n    比例（0.3%），GPT-2(32k边) Jaccard=0.09-0.69 vs Qwen(179k边) Jaccard=0.00-0.04，差一个数量级，(3)\\\\n    单方法 faithfulness 也极低（EP CPR=0.055）。结论：CSS 跨模型 scaling 失败是结构性的，不可通过换方法修复。当前真实成绩：IOI\\\\n    GPT-2 明确 PASS，其余全部 FAIL 或 inconclusive。原 paper framing（CSS 作为正向方法贡献）不再可行。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_qwen05b_ioi_acdc_k3\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: CSS=1.0=0 edges, all Jaccard≈0, FAIL\\\\n  - exp_id: phase2_qwen05b_ioi_k3\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: IFR version also 0 CSS=1.0 edges\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_pilot_gpt2_ioi_v3\\\\n    role: contrast\\\\n    result: GPT-2 IOI PASS, same methods work at 32k scale\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n  - D025\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 21847, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015fMczSTXk2LsrGGKWdRNZy","session_id":"7d450bbd-3b5c-4231-8573-8b79cc8ef481","uuid":"2e72c587-4972-4172-9057-0dccbd01dcde","timestamp":"2026-05-13T09:06:38.599Z"}
